### Sample HTTP requests for the Todolist API
### Works with the IntelliJ HTTP client or the VS Code "REST Client" extension.

@host = http://localhost:8080

### API info
GET {{host}}/

### Health check
GET {{host}}/actuator/health

### Create a todo
POST {{host}}/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Deploy the app to the VPS",
  "description": "Run docker compose up on the server",
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "dueDate": "2026-08-15"
}

### List todos (paged, newest first)
GET {{host}}/api/todos?page=0&size=20&sort=createdAt&direction=desc

### Filter: only open, high priority, text search
GET {{host}}/api/todos?completed=false&priority=HIGH&search=deploy

### Get one todo
GET {{host}}/api/todos/1

### Full update (PUT)
PUT {{host}}/api/todos/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Deploy the app to the VPS",
  "description": "Done via docker compose",
  "completed": true,
  "priority": "MEDIUM",
  "dueDate": "2026-08-15"
}

### Partial update (PATCH) - just toggle completed
PATCH {{host}}/api/todos/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "completed": true
}

### Delete a todo
DELETE {{host}}/api/todos/1
